--- why this log exists ---
The full regression runs 1900+ cases in one process tree. Under host
load a case that holds a socket can lose it (ECONNRESET), so the
same tree reports 0 failures on one run and 1 on the next. A failure
of that shape is a property of the HOST, not of the code.

This log answers the question that decides it: does the failing file
pass on its own, and does this task touch it?

